        "locator": "{\"end_char\": 4257, \"end_line\": 371, \"offset_unit\": \"UNICODE_CODE_POINTS\", \"pdf_file\": null, \"pdf_reference_base\": \"LANE_ROOT\", \"printed_page\": null, \"scan_indexes_0_based\": [], \"span_semantics\": \"EXACT_QUOTE\", \"start_char\": 4124, \"start_line\": 371}",
        "exact_excerpt": " More specifically, results indicate that the Siphnian-type pottery found in Argilos and Andros most probably have common provenance.",
